  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital Skills Training for South-African Women</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The fourth industrial revolution comes with a whole new sector of jobs. These jobs need specific skills and competencies and many of them, both in-country and abroad, are left unfilled. By providing tailor-made training on high-level digital skills (e.g. data science, AI, blockchain engineering), young female graduates will have better chances in the South African digital economy. They will have access to jobs that are now predominately occupied by men. Alternatively, the bourgeoning digital economy in South Africa will have access to local talent that is increasingly sought after.</narrative>
  </description>
